"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-037","source_id":"s-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-current-rendered","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002","quote":"四年，加侍中。五年，遷尚書右僕射，侍中如故。大同三年，以疾陳解，徙為右光祿大夫，給親信二十人。其年，出為雲麾將軍、吳郡太守。先是，何敬容居郡有美績，世稱為何吳郡。及舉為政，聲跡略相比。六年，入為侍中、中書監，未拜，遷太子詹事、翊左將軍，侍中如故。舉父瀹，齊世終此官，累表乞改授，敕不許，久之方就職。九年，遷尚書僕射，侍中、將軍如故。舉雖居端揆，未嘗肯預時務，多因疾陳解。敕輒賜假，並手敕處方，加給上藥。其恩遇如此。其年，以本官參掌選事。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0005"}],"interpretation_note":"保本來源literal親屬詞及完整段，未知共同父母/世次不補；編者父祖合成另在assembly，不冒literal父。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered-xie_ju","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB","surname":"謝","ming":"舉","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0001","source_anchor":{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001","mention_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0001","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"謝舉","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB"},"quote":"謝舉，字言揚，中書令覽之弟也。幼好學，能清言，與覽齊名。舉年十四，嘗贈沈約五言詩，為約稱賞。世人為之語曰：「王有養、炬，謝有覽、舉。」養、炬，王筠、王泰小字也。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"姓名拆分為本完整段的離線編輯判讀；不把官爵/ID後綴當姓名。","zi":"言揚","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-037","source_id":"s-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-current-rendered"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-rendered:p002:m00